flowchart LR
    C[Internal caller] -->|loopback or mTLS| G[Trusted gateway]
    G -->|verified identity| M[Principal middleware]
    M -->|typed principal + evidence:write| P[Auth policy dependency]
    P --> API[Upload route]
    API -->|auth before body| H[ArtifactHandoff]
    API --> I[EvidenceImporter]
    I --> A[Audit actor from canonical subject]
